    "3. **Control risk, tools, and context in an AI-assisted workflow**\n",
    "   - Use least privilege, protect secrets, and separate untrusted content from instructions.\n",
    "   - Explain at a high level how **MCP** can connect an agent to external tools or data without removing permission and approval boundaries.\n",
